WEBVTT

00:12.750 --> 00:14.875
Goodbye, Asamiya.

00:17.166 --> 00:18.666
Stop!

00:29.708 --> 00:30.833
Tatsuya…

00:41.666 --> 00:43.666
What do you want?

00:46.250 --> 00:51.875
Like a savior, a hero appeared
out of nowhere and saved me.

00:54.208 --> 00:55.708
Why are you here?

01:06.500 --> 01:07.625
Let's go.

01:13.916 --> 01:15.958
This hero

01:16.583 --> 01:20.208
was insanely strong and cool.

01:31.750 --> 01:33.416
You okay, Kaho?

01:33.500 --> 01:36.291
Yeah, I'm fine, but…

01:37.166 --> 01:41.208
Even so, I couldn't help…

01:44.500 --> 01:46.916
but resent this hero.

01:51.500 --> 01:52.333
Come on.

01:57.875 --> 01:59.375
And I…

02:01.000 --> 02:03.000
I loathed myself

02:04.333 --> 02:06.583
from the bottom of my heart.

02:10.958 --> 02:12.458
Shimura.

02:32.958 --> 02:35.291
The nightmare finally came to an end.

02:40.125 --> 02:41.625
And so did…

02:43.375 --> 02:44.500
my life.

02:47.625 --> 02:52.458
VIRAL HIT

02:55.166 --> 02:56.125
WHAT'S THIS?

02:56.208 --> 02:57.666
IS HE BACK FOR REAL?!

02:57.750 --> 02:58.750
LONG OVERDUE!

02:58.833 --> 03:00.000
Sorry for the wait!

03:00.583 --> 03:04.166
Hamaken TV is relaunching today.

03:04.250 --> 03:08.458
No more pretending from now on.
You get the real me.

03:08.541 --> 03:11.791
Hey, bastards.
You'd better brace yourselves.

03:12.291 --> 03:13.666
SCUMBAG ACTIVATED LOL

03:13.750 --> 03:14.750
LOVE THIS VERSION

03:14.833 --> 03:17.333
I even brought a guest for you today.

03:17.416 --> 03:20.541
I put a ton of effort
into doing this model's makeup.

03:20.625 --> 03:22.458
I told you I'd do it.

03:22.541 --> 03:23.375
POOR GUY LOL

03:24.041 --> 03:25.541
Hey.

03:26.708 --> 03:30.458
Is it true
you're the editor for Viral Hit?

03:31.666 --> 03:35.541
You turned to the internet
because you don't have real friends?

03:35.625 --> 03:37.083
What a loser!

03:37.166 --> 03:39.333
Hello? Are you listening?

03:39.833 --> 03:41.625
Answer her!

03:42.250 --> 03:43.791
Seriously?

03:44.291 --> 03:46.333
Yikes. What's her problem?

03:46.875 --> 03:48.000
What a freak.

03:48.583 --> 03:49.666
Oh, Shimura.

03:49.750 --> 03:52.791
Come back to us, Shimura.

03:54.916 --> 03:55.833
Edit these.

03:55.916 --> 03:57.416
Get it done by the next break.

03:58.125 --> 04:00.250
But that's a bit too…

04:04.583 --> 04:05.583
Get it done.

04:07.125 --> 04:08.250
Of course.

04:08.333 --> 04:11.125
Just send me the data
and I'll get right to it.

04:14.333 --> 04:16.083
VIRAL HIT'S GONE FOR GOOD

04:16.166 --> 04:18.166
SHIMURA, YOU STILL ALIVE? LOL

04:18.250 --> 04:20.083
THIS CHANNEL IS DEAD LOLOL

04:22.041 --> 04:23.375
Fools.

04:24.875 --> 04:26.416
ARE YOU OKAY?
I'M WORRIED.

04:26.500 --> 04:27.500
PLEASE REPLY

04:31.250 --> 04:34.375
Shimura flaked on us.
Do you know anything, Asamiya?

04:34.458 --> 04:37.666
Uh… Maybe he's under the weather.

04:37.750 --> 04:38.958
I know why.

04:39.041 --> 04:41.250
-Really?
-Look what I found yesterday.

04:41.750 --> 04:43.291
Is that Shimura?

04:43.791 --> 04:45.250
Enough already!

04:45.333 --> 04:46.458
You little bitch.

04:46.541 --> 04:49.708
Hey Asamiya, that's not your voice, is it?

04:50.458 --> 04:51.500
It's not me.

04:51.583 --> 04:53.000
Yeah, I figured.

04:53.083 --> 04:56.541
I'd rather be dead
than have Asamiya see me like that.

04:56.625 --> 04:58.708
I'd be too ashamed to walk outside.

04:58.791 --> 05:00.500
Nothing beats a naked apology.

05:00.583 --> 05:02.583
C'mon, knock it off.

05:03.541 --> 05:05.625
You don't know anything.

05:08.833 --> 05:09.791
Excuse me.

05:10.708 --> 05:11.791
Yeah.

05:12.583 --> 05:14.208
He hasn't been to school.

05:15.125 --> 05:16.375
I see.

05:17.041 --> 05:18.541
I'm worried about him.

05:19.041 --> 05:20.291
His injuries should be fine.

05:20.791 --> 05:22.166
I'm more worried about

05:23.083 --> 05:24.916
how this affected his dignity.

05:26.541 --> 05:30.250
That's one thing we can't help him with.

05:36.208 --> 05:39.041
Really? You bought the mascara?

05:39.125 --> 05:42.458
You should all try it.
I highly recommend it.

05:43.333 --> 05:44.208
HOW'S SHIMURA?

05:44.291 --> 05:45.708
IS VIRAL HIT OVER?

05:45.791 --> 05:46.750
HE WAS TOO COCKY

05:46.833 --> 05:48.500
Viral Hit?

05:49.291 --> 05:50.125
Shimura?

05:50.208 --> 05:51.916
IS SHIMURA COMING TO SCHOOL??

05:52.000 --> 05:53.125
DO A COLLAB PLZ LOL

05:53.208 --> 05:54.333
C'mon, guys.

05:54.416 --> 05:57.208
Stop nagging me about Shimura.

05:57.291 --> 05:59.250
He's basically washed-up.

06:36.250 --> 06:38.375
Nice to meet you… I guess?

06:44.458 --> 06:45.666
I see.

06:46.208 --> 06:48.583
So you're looking for Shimura too.

06:49.416 --> 06:51.875
I'm partly responsible for this.

06:51.958 --> 06:53.625
That makes two of us.

06:54.125 --> 06:56.833
Why? All you did was go on a date.

06:56.916 --> 06:57.750
Huh?

06:57.833 --> 07:00.208
I wouldn't exactly call it a date.

07:03.625 --> 07:08.500
If he runs now,
he'll spend the rest of his life running.

07:09.791 --> 07:10.958
I can't have that.

07:11.041 --> 07:12.041
What do you mean?

07:14.125 --> 07:18.250
Some people find solace
just in seeing someone like him.

07:19.000 --> 07:21.875
Are you saying you're one of them, Aki?

07:23.000 --> 07:24.666
Maybe I am.

07:26.416 --> 07:27.458
I see.

07:29.625 --> 07:33.041
Good grief. What could he be up to?

07:34.666 --> 07:36.125
Sorry to hold you up.

07:36.208 --> 07:38.166
It's okay. I'm glad we talked.

07:38.666 --> 07:39.500
Bye.

07:46.625 --> 07:48.708
I guess I wasn't the only one.

07:50.541 --> 07:52.458
Hamaken TV!

07:52.541 --> 07:53.625
INSTANT MENACE LOL

07:53.708 --> 07:56.416
Since Kanegon is on the Viral Hit team,

07:56.500 --> 07:59.583
he's gonna share
what Kota Shimura's really about.

07:59.666 --> 08:00.750
What?

08:00.833 --> 08:01.750
Hey.

08:03.500 --> 08:05.291
Okay, we're all set.

08:05.375 --> 08:09.041
Be honest. What was Shimura really like?

08:09.125 --> 08:11.333
Well, um…

08:12.125 --> 08:13.041
Shimura was--

08:13.125 --> 08:15.583
Shimura was… what?

08:17.541 --> 08:21.166
Shimura was…

08:21.666 --> 08:23.958
Let's take over the world
with this channel.

08:24.041 --> 08:25.708
You did it, Shimura!

08:26.208 --> 08:29.166
Thanks.
You helped me get my head straight.

08:29.250 --> 08:33.000
Today's the special day
Viral Hit was formed!

08:36.083 --> 08:38.166
He was a…

08:39.583 --> 08:41.000
He was a real scumbag.

08:41.083 --> 08:43.416
Oh, was he now?

08:44.166 --> 08:45.333
He's super greedy.

08:45.416 --> 08:46.375
And?

08:46.458 --> 08:49.875
All he cared about was going viral
and pocketing donations.

08:49.958 --> 08:53.583
And that's why he lied
and accused me of being a fraud, right?

08:54.916 --> 08:58.083
I bet all of his fights were staged.

08:58.166 --> 09:02.500
That guy will do anything for money.

09:03.875 --> 09:06.250
But I thought you were friends.

09:06.333 --> 09:10.208
Give me a break!
That nerdy loser ain't no friend of mine.

09:11.458 --> 09:12.625
I never

09:13.375 --> 09:14.958
wanna work with him again.

09:15.458 --> 09:16.416
You heard him.

09:16.500 --> 09:18.166
You guys get it now?

09:18.750 --> 09:21.208
So, next time on my stream,

09:21.291 --> 09:24.875
Shimura's gonna apologize
for letting you believe he was a hero.

09:24.958 --> 09:27.500
Don't forget to tune in.

09:28.083 --> 09:29.458
Cut.

09:29.541 --> 09:31.375
You've got everyone pumped.

09:31.458 --> 09:32.958
HAMAKEN'S GETTING REVENGE

09:33.041 --> 09:35.583
Looks like I'm a better producer than you.

09:35.666 --> 09:37.291
Yeah, you definitely are.

09:37.375 --> 09:40.375
So, where the hell is Shimura?

09:40.916 --> 09:43.250
How long is he skipping school?

09:43.333 --> 09:45.458
I don't know. We don't talk anymore.

09:45.541 --> 09:46.708
I don't care.

09:46.791 --> 09:49.375
But we're not even friends anymore.

09:49.458 --> 09:50.583
Shut up.

09:52.250 --> 09:55.250
Why would I ever believe anything you say?

09:55.333 --> 09:57.541
You know what you did to me, right?

09:58.125 --> 10:01.458
Imagine what'll happen
if you don't get him to come.

10:01.541 --> 10:03.875
Okay, okay.

10:04.375 --> 10:05.666
I'll bring him here.

10:16.666 --> 10:17.500
Hey.

10:23.000 --> 10:24.500
How's he doing?

10:25.166 --> 10:27.125
-Hey!
-The hell should I know?

10:27.208 --> 10:29.041
Why does everyone ask me?

10:33.541 --> 10:35.208
This is all his fault.

10:36.666 --> 10:38.166
This is all…

10:40.000 --> 10:42.291
-I gotta drag him--
-Where are you going?

10:42.375 --> 10:44.791
To the hospital.
I'm gonna ask where he is.

10:44.875 --> 10:45.833
The hospital?

10:48.375 --> 10:49.875
His mom…

10:51.583 --> 10:53.000
She's hospitalized.

11:01.625 --> 11:02.958
Is that for your son?

11:05.125 --> 11:09.416
If I wasn't so sick,
I'd be able to finish this in a jiffy.

11:10.000 --> 11:12.666
Don't push yourself too hard, Ms. Shimura.

11:14.458 --> 11:16.375
Are you visiting someone?

11:16.458 --> 11:18.291
Oh, uh… Yes.

11:23.916 --> 11:25.125
Um…

11:25.208 --> 11:27.750
Do you know where he… where Kota is?

11:27.833 --> 11:30.250
I really need to talk to him.

11:31.333 --> 11:32.458
To Kota?

11:35.083 --> 11:40.708
I'm sorry you came all this way,
but he hasn't visited me in a few days.

11:41.208 --> 11:43.000
He seems to be busy.

11:43.500 --> 11:46.083
I see. Thank you.

11:47.208 --> 11:48.458
Any chance

11:49.666 --> 11:51.125
you're Kaneko?

11:51.708 --> 11:52.541
Huh?

11:54.041 --> 11:56.000
-Yes.
-I thought so.

11:57.000 --> 12:00.875
Kota talked about you
with a big smile on his face.

12:01.375 --> 12:03.833
You're the first friend he made in class.

12:05.333 --> 12:09.041
He says he likes school now
because you're there.

12:11.000 --> 12:16.083
I've caused him a lot of trouble
because of my situation.

12:16.583 --> 12:19.875
I was worried he wasn't enjoying school.

12:23.291 --> 12:26.625
Thank you for being his friend.

12:31.041 --> 12:31.875
Sure.

12:39.000 --> 12:40.250
Goodbye.

13:13.041 --> 13:15.083
What are you waiting for?

13:17.791 --> 13:18.916
It will hurt.

13:19.916 --> 13:21.541
More than any punch.

13:23.583 --> 13:25.250
Leave me alone.

13:27.083 --> 13:27.916
It's…

13:31.000 --> 13:32.750
My life is over.

13:34.666 --> 13:37.166
You saw how pathetic I was.

13:39.333 --> 13:41.541
There's no point in staying alive.

13:43.583 --> 13:44.541
I might

13:45.416 --> 13:47.083
as well die.

14:04.375 --> 14:05.208
What the…?

14:17.958 --> 14:19.583
They're waiting for you.

14:21.708 --> 14:24.916
Viral Hit's subscriber count
is still increasing.

14:27.000 --> 14:28.000
So?

14:30.041 --> 14:33.333
The next video's views
will be unprecedented.

14:33.416 --> 14:34.375
So what?

14:34.458 --> 14:36.416
It's your chance to earn big money.

14:36.500 --> 14:38.708
I don't care. Leave me alone!

14:41.375 --> 14:42.458
I see.

14:43.916 --> 14:44.750
Forget it.

14:49.250 --> 14:51.291
I've been here a few times myself.

14:57.083 --> 14:59.541
If you want to die, find a different spot.

15:13.000 --> 15:15.333
Hey, Tatsuya.

15:16.916 --> 15:17.750
You got a guest.

15:24.041 --> 15:25.375
Already been a month, huh?

15:26.750 --> 15:29.250
He hasn't shown up to work either.

15:30.666 --> 15:33.791
And he hasn't read any of my messages.

15:35.500 --> 15:38.875
He won't disappear on us, will he?

15:42.375 --> 15:43.541
You bastard!

15:44.166 --> 15:47.375
What're you gonna do to make up for this?

15:47.458 --> 15:48.833
FAILED THE MISSION LOL

15:48.916 --> 15:51.458
He wasn't home and I can't get a hold of--

15:51.541 --> 15:53.833
You think your sorry excuse's gonna fly?

15:55.125 --> 15:56.041
Hey.

15:56.125 --> 15:58.458
My viewers are waiting on me.

15:58.541 --> 16:01.666
Why don't you send him a video?

16:01.750 --> 16:03.500
Show him Kanegon's predicament.

16:04.333 --> 16:05.166
Good idea.

16:05.250 --> 16:06.833
-Here, film this.
-Sure.

16:09.125 --> 16:10.041
Tell him.

16:10.541 --> 16:13.333
Tell Shimura to get his ass over here.

16:15.000 --> 16:16.125
Hurry up!

16:16.916 --> 16:18.500
Rather get banged up, huh?

16:19.708 --> 16:22.916
As soon as Shimura gets here,
you're free to go.

16:23.416 --> 16:25.875
Now, tell him to get his ass here.

16:33.375 --> 16:35.708
Shimura.

16:35.791 --> 16:38.708
You're the first friend he made in class.

16:40.750 --> 16:41.666
I beg you…

16:48.416 --> 16:49.250
don't come!

16:50.208 --> 16:52.041
He'll kill you if you do.

16:53.500 --> 16:54.416
Hey…

16:56.791 --> 16:58.625
The hell was that?

16:59.125 --> 17:00.000
Hey.

17:03.083 --> 17:04.750
You got a death wish?

17:04.833 --> 17:05.708
Hey.

17:10.583 --> 17:11.791
Hamaken.

17:21.375 --> 17:22.375
At last.

17:38.583 --> 17:39.416
Kanegon.

17:41.333 --> 17:42.458
Roll the camera.

17:51.625 --> 17:52.625
One last thing.

17:56.958 --> 17:58.500
You're not in this alone.

18:15.375 --> 18:16.583
Are you rolling,

18:17.916 --> 18:18.791
Kanegon?

18:22.333 --> 18:23.250
Yeah.

18:27.958 --> 18:29.875
The title of this video is

18:30.375 --> 18:32.541
"How to Beat a Thug in a Fight."

18:32.625 --> 18:33.458
HE'S BAAACK!

18:38.250 --> 18:39.833
You don't have to worry.

18:39.916 --> 18:40.833
Look.

18:42.500 --> 18:44.166
THE UNDERDOG STRIKES BACK!

18:44.250 --> 18:46.208
I NEED YOU TO WIN THIS ONE

18:47.083 --> 18:48.458
Took you long enough.

18:48.541 --> 18:50.750
I didn't come for you.

18:50.833 --> 18:54.166
You're really that desperate for money?

18:55.625 --> 18:57.375
You filthy beggar.

19:00.958 --> 19:04.875
HOW TO BEAT A THUG IN A FIGHT

19:05.458 --> 19:08.500
You want to beat up the guy
who's been bullying you.

19:08.583 --> 19:13.125
If you are serious about taking them on,
I'll teach you everything.

19:13.208 --> 19:15.125
Try to keep up.

19:15.625 --> 19:21.041
Fighting Secrets, Rule One:
A Body of Steel.

19:21.541 --> 19:25.250
It's impossible for an amateur fighter
to dodge every attack.

19:25.333 --> 19:29.791
Instead, focus on building
a strong body that can withstand blows.

19:31.416 --> 19:35.625
After you've built your outer muscles,
work on your deep muscles.

19:35.708 --> 19:39.041
Strengthen your core
to prepare for a counterattack.

19:40.208 --> 19:44.458
Make sure to eat
high-quality protein after workouts.

19:44.541 --> 19:49.791
While muscle is important in a fight,
weight can also be a key factor.

19:49.875 --> 19:54.500
Make sure you're eating enough to bulk up.

19:55.000 --> 19:58.750
Fighting Secrets, Rule Two: Stamina.

19:58.833 --> 20:02.666
All this training will mean nothing
if you don't have stamina.

20:02.750 --> 20:06.833
Work on both your muscular
and cardiovascular endurance.

20:08.041 --> 20:12.166
Just so you know, you shouldn't expect
dramatic physical changes

20:12.250 --> 20:15.375
after only a few weeks of training.

20:16.083 --> 20:17.791
-What?
-However!

20:17.875 --> 20:23.208
If you master this one technique,
you just might have a shot at winning.

20:23.291 --> 20:26.958
Fighting Secrets, Rule Three: Technique.

20:27.041 --> 20:29.166
Master this finishing move.

20:33.250 --> 20:34.083
Come at me.

20:37.708 --> 20:38.916
You bastard.

20:40.458 --> 20:41.875
I'll fucking kill you.

20:56.958 --> 20:57.958
You twerp!

21:17.416 --> 21:19.875
You think you can mess with me?

21:21.416 --> 21:22.458
You're just a loser!

21:23.333 --> 21:24.291
Come here.

21:37.625 --> 21:40.000
What's wrong? That all you got?

21:40.708 --> 21:42.000
Fight me.

22:10.916 --> 22:13.125
Are you ready to fight back?

22:13.208 --> 22:15.625
A certain martial arts champion once said

22:15.708 --> 22:20.791
if he had to choose just one technique
to use against a formidable opponent,

22:20.875 --> 22:22.916
this would be it.

22:24.000 --> 22:25.166
You piece of trash.

22:26.333 --> 22:28.750
You've got some nerve!

22:28.833 --> 22:32.000
Turn your body towards your kicking leg.

22:33.375 --> 22:37.625
The moment your opponent shifts
his weight onto his lead foot,

22:38.833 --> 22:45.500
rotate your entire body
and swing your leg all the way.

22:52.541 --> 22:54.375
Did… it work?

22:59.791 --> 23:02.083
Your efforts will never let you down.

23:03.250 --> 23:07.416
Focus on mastering this one technique,
and practice till you drop!

23:22.333 --> 23:23.500
Shimura.

23:26.375 --> 23:30.291
You've got to be joking.
Was that supposed to be a low kick?

23:31.625 --> 23:34.916
You aim for the thigh with a low kick,
dumbass!

23:40.625 --> 23:42.291
That didn't hurt one bit.

23:42.375 --> 23:43.458
THX FOR THE INPUT

23:54.333 --> 23:57.666
A low kick aims for the thigh,
which is padded with muscle.

23:58.333 --> 24:02.166
But he went for the calf,
which isn't nearly as protected.

24:03.125 --> 24:04.250
That's a calf kick.

24:04.333 --> 24:05.958
You're dead meat!

24:07.125 --> 24:08.333
Get off of me.

24:10.083 --> 24:11.958
You brat!

24:16.958 --> 24:19.500
You got this!

24:23.291 --> 24:25.666
I'm gonna fucking kill you!

24:25.750 --> 24:27.375
HE LANDED ANOTHER KICK!

24:27.458 --> 24:28.791
SHIMURA'S DOING GREAT

24:28.875 --> 24:30.208
HE CAN WIN?!

24:32.833 --> 24:35.416
You little shit!

24:47.291 --> 24:49.708
Is that the only move you got?

24:50.291 --> 24:52.125
I WAS THINKING THE SAME THING

24:52.208 --> 24:53.958
HAMAKEN'S GOT A POINT

24:54.041 --> 24:55.125
SHIMURA'S DONE FOR

24:56.291 --> 24:57.916
That won't work anymore!

25:13.375 --> 25:14.250
Shimura!

25:14.333 --> 25:15.500
HE MIGHT REALLY DIE

25:15.583 --> 25:17.000
IT'S OKAY TO SURRENDER

25:31.833 --> 25:35.125
You really are a hopeless loser.

25:40.541 --> 25:41.708
When did I

25:43.041 --> 25:45.833
become such a loser?

25:48.375 --> 25:49.916
The moment I was born?

25:50.875 --> 25:53.208
No, of course that's not true.

25:54.291 --> 25:56.833
I used to have an ordinary school life.

25:57.333 --> 25:59.000
-Right?
-Hey!

26:00.875 --> 26:02.166
You're annoying.

26:04.291 --> 26:06.833
That was, until Hamaken showed up.

26:06.916 --> 26:08.458
-Hey.
-Ow!

26:10.833 --> 26:14.041
I didn't understand why he punched me.

26:14.125 --> 26:17.166
Ow! That really hurts!

26:17.666 --> 26:22.083
But there was nothing to understand
because there was no reason.

26:24.166 --> 26:27.250
That's when I started hating school.

26:28.125 --> 26:31.166
I became afraid of
making eye contact with people.

26:32.833 --> 26:36.666
I always hunched over
to make myself look smaller.

26:40.666 --> 26:41.583
But…

26:42.625 --> 26:43.666
I'm…

26:57.166 --> 27:00.583
Good for you
for getting back on your feet.

27:08.083 --> 27:09.208
You still wanna go?

27:09.291 --> 27:12.791
Sure. I'll take you on.

27:12.875 --> 27:17.041
Now, believe in yourself.

27:19.583 --> 27:22.666
You're so annoying, you piece of trash!

27:24.625 --> 27:26.125
I'm…

27:29.250 --> 27:30.416
I'm…

27:36.666 --> 27:38.000
Now's your chance.

27:42.791 --> 27:45.708
I'm not a loser!

27:50.541 --> 27:53.958
Overhand hook.

28:11.708 --> 28:13.333
I'M ACTUALLY TEARING UP

28:13.416 --> 28:14.916
THIS DESERVES A MOVIE

28:15.000 --> 28:16.250
WE'RE ALL CRYING

28:18.875 --> 28:20.500
No way…

28:42.125 --> 28:43.416
You were awesome.

28:49.833 --> 28:51.458
So no more crying.

28:58.916 --> 28:59.875
Shimura.

29:02.541 --> 29:03.500
LEGENDARY

29:03.583 --> 29:04.791
SHIMURA'S THE MAN

29:06.250 --> 29:07.791
That was a brilliant win.

29:25.791 --> 29:26.708
Shimura.

29:27.791 --> 29:28.708
Thank you.

29:34.666 --> 29:35.708
Thanks.

29:40.333 --> 29:41.458
How many?

29:41.541 --> 29:42.375
Huh?

29:43.166 --> 29:44.041
Twice?

29:44.541 --> 29:46.666
We already have over 700,000 views.

29:47.208 --> 29:50.000
It's only a matter of time
before we hit a million.

29:50.541 --> 29:51.916
What about donations?

29:52.000 --> 29:53.500
-Hey.
-Let's see…

29:53.583 --> 29:54.958
Over a million yen.

29:55.041 --> 29:59.333
That means… we get 600,000 yen.

30:00.625 --> 30:03.375
I thought you came to save me.

30:03.458 --> 30:06.125
Why would I do that?
I did it for the money.

30:07.125 --> 30:10.166
You bastard! I got emotional for nothing.

30:10.250 --> 30:13.666
-I thought you came for--
-"He'll do anything for money."

30:13.750 --> 30:14.750
Your words.

30:15.333 --> 30:16.416
You saw that…

30:17.375 --> 30:19.916
Sorry for being a scumbag.

30:20.541 --> 30:22.833
I bet you don't have any friends.

30:22.916 --> 30:26.333
Whatever.
It's not like you have any either.

30:26.833 --> 30:27.666
What was that?

30:29.375 --> 30:30.958
You wanna fight?

30:31.041 --> 30:32.166
I'll take you on.

30:33.958 --> 30:35.125
That's my move.

30:35.208 --> 30:36.125
Shut up.

30:58.250 --> 30:59.750
I hope he comes today.

31:00.583 --> 31:01.416
Shimura!

31:01.500 --> 31:02.833
Oh, Shimura!

31:02.916 --> 31:03.750
Shimura.

31:03.833 --> 31:06.500
Thanks, man. You were incredible.

31:06.583 --> 31:10.416
Hamaken hasn't come to school
since that day.

31:11.000 --> 31:15.666
I know that what he's afraid of isn't me.

31:16.208 --> 31:19.333
It's the reality that
he's hit rock bottom.

31:20.166 --> 31:23.541
I'm sorry I never tried to intervene.

31:23.625 --> 31:26.375
That's okay. It was out of your hands.

31:26.458 --> 31:27.958
You're such a saint!

31:28.041 --> 31:31.000
When I think about
what Hamaken's going through now…

31:32.833 --> 31:35.416
I'm elated! Serves him right.

31:35.500 --> 31:37.458
Okay, okay.

31:38.041 --> 31:40.541
Now do you understand how awesome we are?

31:40.625 --> 31:43.916
Thanks to me,
the producer and creator of the--

31:44.000 --> 31:46.500
Shimura, let's go to karaoke sometime.

31:46.583 --> 31:48.291
Huh? Well…

31:48.375 --> 31:50.375
Sure, on my day off from work.

31:50.458 --> 31:51.958
-You mean it?
-Hey…

31:53.125 --> 31:53.958
Geez.

31:57.625 --> 31:58.625
Oh god, ew.

31:58.708 --> 32:00.000
She's super cringe.

32:00.083 --> 32:01.375
Is she for real?

32:01.458 --> 32:04.291
They're dissing her
because she's Hamaken's girl.

32:04.875 --> 32:06.000
She's so boring.

32:06.083 --> 32:06.916
Totally.

32:09.583 --> 32:11.291
-Let's go to the bathroom.
-Yup.

32:17.250 --> 32:18.750
NEW MESSAGE

32:19.666 --> 32:22.833
INVITATION TO PARTNER
AS AN OFFICIAL INFLUENCER

32:27.250 --> 32:28.416
Are you alone?

32:29.125 --> 32:30.166
Hey, Aki.

32:30.666 --> 32:31.750
Where's Shimura?

32:32.666 --> 32:34.041
The hell should I know?

32:36.958 --> 32:37.791
What's wrong?

32:43.208 --> 32:45.541
I get that he's extraordinary.

32:46.500 --> 32:47.458
I do, but…

32:48.833 --> 32:49.750
You're jealous.

32:49.833 --> 32:52.125
-I'm not.
-Jealousy isn't attractive.

32:52.208 --> 32:53.583
I'm not jealous, okay?

32:57.291 --> 33:01.583
Your job is to find his next opponent.

33:05.333 --> 33:07.166
I have high hopes for you.

33:13.500 --> 33:14.916
High hopes?

33:17.000 --> 33:18.125
Seriously?

33:19.333 --> 33:20.750
CANDY CROWN CEO EIJI KIMISHIMA

33:20.833 --> 33:25.791
As I mentioned in my DM,
I was hoping you'd join our agency.

33:26.833 --> 33:30.083
We belong to the renowned
B. F. PROMOTION group,

33:30.166 --> 33:33.250
so we can offer modeling gigs
and roles on dating shows.

33:33.833 --> 33:35.708
Once you get more exposure--

33:35.791 --> 33:36.791
Will that get me

33:38.250 --> 33:39.416
more followers?

33:42.166 --> 33:43.791
I want more followers.

33:46.500 --> 33:49.250
Of course. Leave it to me.

33:51.666 --> 33:53.208
Are you free after this?

33:59.916 --> 34:02.041
I'm sorry for the inconvenience.

34:02.125 --> 34:03.083
Terribly sorry.

34:07.291 --> 34:08.833
I'm terribly sorry for--

34:11.291 --> 34:12.750
-Excuse me.
-Excuse me.

34:13.250 --> 34:14.791
Sorry, I didn't see you.

34:14.875 --> 34:17.000
It's okay. This was my fault.

34:18.291 --> 34:19.250
Here, use this.

34:20.500 --> 34:21.833
-Thanks.
-Sure.

34:22.500 --> 34:23.833
Good to see you back.

34:26.125 --> 34:27.250
It's been a second.

34:30.500 --> 34:34.583
I'm really sorry I made you worry.

34:35.708 --> 34:38.291
I knew you had texted me,

34:38.875 --> 34:42.125
but after you saw me like that, I…

34:43.458 --> 34:44.291
Thank you.

34:47.041 --> 34:49.416
I know you were protecting me once again.

34:52.833 --> 34:55.916
It's okay. You've already saved me enough.

34:57.416 --> 34:58.250
Really?

34:58.333 --> 35:02.083
Now it's my turn to save you.

35:03.416 --> 35:04.833
Gosh.

35:09.750 --> 35:10.708
Hey.

35:12.250 --> 35:15.416
Will you go to a café with me again?

35:16.000 --> 35:17.458
Next time, it's on me.

35:17.541 --> 35:18.875
Really? Yay!

35:19.833 --> 35:20.708
Yay.

35:21.333 --> 35:22.458
Promise?

35:22.541 --> 35:23.541
I promise.

35:23.625 --> 35:24.458
See you.

35:24.958 --> 35:25.916
See you.

36:04.500 --> 36:06.166
Welcome home, Kaho.

36:06.666 --> 36:08.000
Hello, Akiko.

36:26.750 --> 36:28.083
Brief me on your day.

36:28.958 --> 36:31.208
I was with Tatsuya until just now.

36:31.291 --> 36:32.291
The reason being?

36:32.916 --> 36:34.958
-To discuss college…
-How long exactly?

36:36.333 --> 36:37.291
Two hours.

36:38.291 --> 36:40.458
He's an MMA fighter, isn't he?

36:41.166 --> 36:44.250
Will someone like him
be beneficial to your future?

36:45.583 --> 36:48.291
Try not to waste too much time.

36:50.500 --> 36:51.333
Okay.

36:52.833 --> 36:53.791
Please excuse me.

36:53.875 --> 36:55.500
Were you with any other men?

36:58.250 --> 36:59.458
No, I wasn't.

37:06.125 --> 37:06.958
Rumi.

37:08.666 --> 37:09.500
You're great.

37:18.208 --> 37:19.708
560,000 followers?

37:19.791 --> 37:22.166
Can you believe it?
Our channel's blowing up.

37:22.875 --> 37:25.916
This is all thanks to my producing skills.

37:26.541 --> 37:27.541
Check it out.

37:29.833 --> 37:30.833
BAD FELLOWS, huh?

37:30.916 --> 37:32.833
-What's that?
-Seriously?

37:33.500 --> 37:36.416
It's a popular show where
amateur fighters face off.

37:36.500 --> 37:38.208
After the show's success,

37:38.291 --> 37:42.625
the CEO was able to branch out
into the entertainment industry.

37:43.583 --> 37:44.416
So?

37:46.666 --> 37:48.166
Read the comments.

37:49.708 --> 37:50.708
IT LOOKS STAGED

37:50.791 --> 37:52.541
I PREFER VIRAL HIT

37:52.625 --> 37:54.125
VIRAL HIT IS LEGIT

37:55.000 --> 37:57.916
Our popularity has reached this channel.

37:58.000 --> 37:59.666
Get to the point.

37:59.750 --> 38:03.166
The point is, our advantage is
that we offer the real deal.

38:03.250 --> 38:04.833
VIRAL HIT IS LEGIT

38:04.916 --> 38:06.125
Yeah, and?

38:06.208 --> 38:08.708
I have the next opponent lined up for you.

38:09.458 --> 38:12.041
That's right,
this genius producer set it all up.

38:22.083 --> 38:23.083
Let's go home.

38:23.583 --> 38:24.916
Wait, why?

38:25.000 --> 38:27.166
The weight difference is absurd.

38:27.250 --> 38:30.250
I thought it would be
an interesting visual spin.

38:30.333 --> 38:34.083
Kanegon, why don't you fight them first
and see how safe it is?

38:34.166 --> 38:35.000
What?

38:37.875 --> 38:39.583
Hands to the ground.

38:53.666 --> 38:54.666
Ready…

38:54.750 --> 38:55.791
I surrender!

38:58.541 --> 39:01.458
Now you know how I feel
every time I fight.

39:01.541 --> 39:05.083
Assessing safety is an important part
of the producer's job.

39:05.583 --> 39:07.750
I was trying to make you proud, Aki.

39:07.833 --> 39:10.458
Next time, book me a decent opponent.

39:11.750 --> 39:13.666
That's not fair.

39:15.291 --> 39:18.291
Then try doing it on your own.

39:18.375 --> 39:20.875
I guess we have no choice.
We'll do just that.

39:21.708 --> 39:22.541
Let's go.

39:26.125 --> 39:27.375
What the heck?

39:29.666 --> 39:34.333
We should hold a strategy meeting
to figure out how to find your opponents.

39:34.416 --> 39:36.333
And content other than fights.

39:36.416 --> 39:37.250
Yeah.

39:37.916 --> 39:40.125
Hey, wanna come over to my place?

39:42.875 --> 39:43.708
Oh, um…

39:44.250 --> 39:48.625
My father will get worried
if I visit a guy who lives by himself.

39:48.708 --> 39:49.791
You're right.

39:50.291 --> 39:52.541
We'll call off the meeting then.

39:53.791 --> 39:54.708
No.

39:56.125 --> 39:58.833
We still need to hold a meeting.

40:03.666 --> 40:06.000
FOLLOWERS 71,000

40:18.833 --> 40:20.333
Look. Over 70K.

40:20.416 --> 40:22.541
RUMI
BEAUTY-LOVING HIGH SCHOOL GIRL (17)

40:22.625 --> 40:24.416
You can aim much higher.

40:24.916 --> 40:27.875
Can I get 600,000?
I want to beat them ASAP.

40:27.958 --> 40:30.333
Don't worry. I have a plan.

40:31.291 --> 40:32.125
Come here.

40:34.208 --> 40:37.000
I'll do anything for you, Rumi.

40:39.791 --> 40:41.125
Say, Rumi…

40:46.333 --> 40:48.375
Don't listen to them!

40:49.250 --> 40:50.375
Kanegon.

40:50.875 --> 40:51.958
What is it?

40:52.041 --> 40:53.416
What are you doing alone?

40:53.500 --> 40:54.416
Can't you tell?

40:54.500 --> 40:56.416
Are you guys fighting?

40:56.500 --> 40:57.666
Shut up.

40:58.750 --> 41:00.083
They're horrible.

41:01.125 --> 41:04.333
But I know how amazing you are, Kanegon.

41:09.916 --> 41:11.916
BARBER YASHIO

41:33.291 --> 41:35.000
Did something good happen?

41:35.083 --> 41:36.500
It sure did.

41:36.583 --> 41:39.333
You're bringing over a friend
for the first time.

41:39.416 --> 41:41.791
Not a friend, a comrade.

41:41.875 --> 41:45.458
A comrade?
So you've made a very close friend.

41:46.583 --> 41:47.916
Hello.

41:48.000 --> 41:49.041
Welcome.

41:49.125 --> 41:50.041
You're late.

41:50.125 --> 41:51.541
Sorry. I kinda got lost.

41:51.625 --> 41:53.291
-Let's go.
-Oh, okay.

41:53.791 --> 41:55.541
I'm Shimura, from school.

41:55.625 --> 41:57.833
Oh… Nice to meet you.

41:58.416 --> 41:59.916
Thank you for having me.

42:02.458 --> 42:03.541
A guy?

42:05.750 --> 42:08.041
-Cheers!
-Yeah, cheers!

42:08.625 --> 42:11.083
Are you really the producer of Viral Hit?

42:11.166 --> 42:13.125
-Is that a big deal?
-Yes!

42:13.208 --> 42:15.333
Your videos pop up on my Instagram.

42:15.416 --> 42:16.708
You're so popular.

42:16.791 --> 42:19.500
-Really?
-People don't understand.

42:19.583 --> 42:21.708
The producer matters most.

42:21.791 --> 42:25.291
It's okay. They don't know
what goes on behind the scenes.

42:25.375 --> 42:26.708
You're so mature.

42:26.791 --> 42:28.333
-Totally.
-Totally.

42:28.416 --> 42:29.833
You think so?

42:29.916 --> 42:32.541
If it were me, I'd complain for sure.

42:32.625 --> 42:35.083
I'd say,
"I'm the reason the show is a hit."

42:35.166 --> 42:36.250
Take it easy.

42:36.750 --> 42:41.125
As long as I have
people like you who understand, I'm good.

42:41.625 --> 42:44.041
Today's on me. Drink up.

42:44.125 --> 42:46.208
You sure? I won't hold back.

42:46.291 --> 42:48.625
Here we go. Cheers!

42:53.666 --> 42:54.750
Love it!

42:57.625 --> 43:00.708
It was a flop.
We didn't get a single donation.

43:00.791 --> 43:02.416
Not even a single yen?

43:02.916 --> 43:05.375
This is my next opponent!

43:06.916 --> 43:08.333
VIRAL HIT LIVE NOW

43:08.416 --> 43:10.791
Looks like this isn't
what they want from you.

43:10.875 --> 43:12.166
FIGHT ALREADY

43:14.333 --> 43:15.375
How much so far?

43:15.458 --> 43:18.000
735,300 yen.

43:18.708 --> 43:20.375
That's not nearly enough.

43:20.458 --> 43:22.833
TOTAL AMOUNT DUE: 3,140,000 YEN

43:23.416 --> 43:26.041
I guess it has to be a fight…

43:29.416 --> 43:32.333
Hey, Kanegon. Give me some editing tips.

43:32.416 --> 43:33.333
You wanna learn?

43:33.416 --> 43:34.708
Yes!

43:34.791 --> 43:36.000
Show them.

43:36.083 --> 43:37.458
-No way!
-Really?

43:37.541 --> 43:39.416
I guess I have no choice.

43:39.500 --> 43:41.000
I'm so happy.

43:48.166 --> 43:50.083
I should get going.

43:50.166 --> 43:52.375
I didn't realize how late it was.

43:53.500 --> 43:54.500
Hey…

43:55.666 --> 43:57.250
That video…

43:58.333 --> 43:59.375
-Video?
-Uh…

44:00.125 --> 44:01.333
Never mind.

44:01.958 --> 44:04.583
I also have something I wanted to ask you.

44:05.500 --> 44:06.333
Who

44:08.000 --> 44:09.750
is teaching you how to fight?

44:16.458 --> 44:19.208
HOW TO BEAT A THUG IN A FIGHT

44:21.125 --> 44:21.958
I…

44:25.625 --> 44:26.583
I'm self-taught.

44:28.458 --> 44:29.750
Self-taught…

44:32.208 --> 44:33.333
See you around.

44:42.541 --> 44:44.750
So, it wasn't Aki.

44:52.125 --> 44:52.958
Huh?

44:54.833 --> 44:58.333
PASSWORD INCORRECT

45:07.583 --> 45:08.708
Give us more!

45:09.583 --> 45:10.708
We want more.

45:10.791 --> 45:12.041
Sorry, girls.

45:12.125 --> 45:13.291
Why?

45:13.375 --> 45:17.291
What's up, Aki? Did you miss my voice?

45:17.375 --> 45:19.541
Did you change the channel password?

45:20.041 --> 45:21.000
Password?

45:21.083 --> 45:22.166
No, why?

45:22.666 --> 45:23.916
Here, Kanegon. Drink.

45:24.000 --> 45:26.458
Not now. I'm on a call.

45:35.708 --> 45:36.541
Hello?

45:36.625 --> 45:38.625
We have an emergency. Get back here.

45:38.708 --> 45:40.625
What do you mean, "emergency"?

45:41.125 --> 45:42.916
The Viral Hit account

45:43.875 --> 45:45.208
has been suspended.

45:46.458 --> 45:49.208
But we were using it just a minute ago.

45:49.291 --> 45:50.708
We've been hacked.

45:51.291 --> 45:52.166
Hold on a sec.

45:52.250 --> 45:53.500
DEPOSIT: 735,300 YEN

45:53.583 --> 45:54.708
Does that mean…

45:56.583 --> 46:00.208
It means we're not getting any money.

46:03.208 --> 46:04.041
Hey.

46:04.958 --> 46:05.791
What's wrong?

46:07.333 --> 46:08.791
Did something happen?

46:10.791 --> 46:11.708
Answer me.

46:37.083 --> 46:38.666
This is a warning.

46:42.250 --> 46:43.083
Shimura?

46:43.791 --> 46:44.875
What's wrong?

46:44.958 --> 46:46.333
Answer me, Shimura.

46:46.916 --> 46:48.583
Hey, Shimura.

46:49.083 --> 46:51.083
Answer me, Shimura!

47:03.541 --> 47:10.541
VIRAL HIT

48:26.250 --> 48:31.250
Subtitle translation by:
Kanako Connie Takahashi
